IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `rra-nouns`

-- Retirement and Re-employment Act 1993 (Singapore), 2020 Revised Edition, informal
-- consolidation in force from 1 July 2022 -- THREE-VALUED HELPERS.
--
-- This module holds no law.  It is the small piece of three-valued logic that the
-- modules of the Act use to combine answers, so that a limb whose answer is not yet
-- known does not hide a limb whose answer is no.
--   JUST TRUE   the answer is yes
--   JUST FALSE  the answer is no
--   NOTHING     the answer is not known, or the Act does not give one
-- (How a "no" and a "not covered" are reached in this encoding is in NOTES.md,
-- "Reading a result: FALSE and NOTHING".)

-- Every one of the answers must be yes.  A single no decides the matter even if
-- another answer is not known; otherwise one unknown answer leaves the whole unknown.
GIVEN answers IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`every one of these answers is yes` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a EQUALS JUST FALSE) answers
    THEN JUST FALSE
    ELSE IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a EQUALS NOTHING) answers
         THEN NOTHING
         ELSE JUST TRUE

-- At least one of the answers must be yes.  A single yes decides the matter even if
-- another answer is not known; otherwise one unknown answer leaves the whole unknown.
GIVEN answers IS A LIST OF MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`at least one of these answers is yes` MEANS
    IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a EQUALS JUST TRUE) answers
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE IF any (GIVEN a YIELD a EQUALS NOTHING) answers
         THEN NOTHING
         ELSE JUST FALSE

-- The opposite of an answer: yes becomes no, no becomes yes, unknown stays unknown.
GIVEN answer IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`the opposite of this answer` MEANS
    CONSIDER answer
    WHEN JUST x THEN JUST (NOT x)
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING

-- Arithmetic, not law: whether a fine and a term of imprisonment are each within a penalty's ceilings.
-- ("A fine not exceeding $5,000 or imprisonment for a term not exceeding 6 months or both": each ceiling bounds its own
-- kind of punishment, and both may be imposed together.)
GIVEN penalty IS A Penalty
      fine IS A NUMBER
      months IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`the fine and the term are within the ceilings` MEANS
    fine AT MOST penalty's `maximum fine in dollars` AND months AT MOST penalty's `maximum imprisonment in months`
